# Xiaomi 13 (fuxi): libssc exposes accelerometer and proximity on ADSP too.
# Keep the distribution"s light/compass tags and avoid the secure FastRPC node.
# ACCEL_MOUNT_MATRIX: the sensor sits 180° from the panel frame, so X and Y are
# negated; without it auto-rotate turns the opposite way (2026-11-04).
ACTION!="remove", SUBSYSTEM=="misc", KERNEL=="fastrpc-adsp", ENV{IIO_SENSOR_PROXY_TYPE}+="ssc-accel ssc-proximity", ENV{ACCEL_MOUNT_MATRIX}="-1,0,0;0,-1,0;0,0,1"
